# Copy to .scan-denylist (gitignored) and add one extended regex per line.
#
# This exists because the main rules in scripts/scan-secrets.sh are published,
# so a name whose mere mention is the disclosure cannot live there. Private
# repository names, client names, internal service names, an employer — those
# go here, on the machine, and never leave it.
#
# Case-insensitive matching is NOT automatic; write the pattern to cover it.
#
# Examples of the shape (not real):
# [Mm]y[Pp]rivate[Aa]pp
# (?i)acme-internal          # note: POSIX ERE has no (?i) — use [Aa][Cc]...
# [Cc]lient[Nn]ame
